## Frequently asked questions

### Can a professional services firm get recommended by ChatGPT or Copilot?

Yes, a professional services firm can be recommended by ChatGPT or Copilot. Nobody controls the outcome. Firms with named experts, specific service pages, consistent facts and accurate third-party listings give AI assistants more to find and cross-check. No one can guarantee a mention. Answers vary by assistant, prompt and user.

### Does the AI visibility audit include implementation or just reporting?

No, the £1,500 AI visibility audit covers measurement and planning rather than implementation. It delivers the baseline, the source map, a prioritised plan and a walkthrough. Implementation is a separate scope.

It can run through an [SEO retainer](/services/seo-retainer/) or your own team.

### Do I need a retainer after the audit?

No, you do not need a retainer after the £495 technical SEO audit. Your own team or web developer can carry out the audit actions. The £495 is credited against your first month when a retainer starts within 60 days of delivery.

